From 2d51c6a251e5ebbcb4954007ee8deb9e531d80e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 03:48:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Show Codex and Claude weekly window cost next to Today

Pair the live Weekly quota bar with local cost and token totals for the
current reset window, and list the previous few weeks under the daily
chart so spend can be compared without switching the 30-day history.

Co-authored-by: stabeyzhou <stabeyzhou@gmail.com>
